              "audioEnd": 9.963
            },
            {
              "text": "While the sisters complained about their new life, the youngest daughter named Beauty worked hard and always smiled.",
              "audioStart": 10.825,
              "audioEnd": 16.425
            },
            {
              "text": "She was very good to everyone in the family.",
              "audioStart": 17.288,
              "audioEnd": 19.462
            },
            {
              "text": "Every single day, she helped her father and sisters with many different tasks around the small house.",
              "audioStart": 20.325,
              "audioEnd": 25.7
            },
            {
              "text": "The family had very little money left, but Beauty always tried to keep everyone happy and full of belief about the future.",
              "audioStart": 26.562,
              "audioEnd": 32.85
            },
            {
              "text": "Her older sisters often sat around and cried about their lost wealth, but Beauty never did that.",
              "audioStart": 33.712,
              "audioEnd": 38.913
            },
            {
              "text": "Instead, she cooked meals, cleaned the rooms, and made sure that her father felt loved.",
              "audioStart": 39.775,
              "audioEnd": 44.75
            },
            {
              "text": "The father often looked at his youngest daughter with great pride and deep feeling.",
              "audioStart": 45.612,
              "audioEnd": 49.562
            },
            {
              "text": "He knew that life would be much harder without her gentle help and constant smile.",
              "audioStart": 50.425,
              "audioEnd": 54.325
            },
            {
              "text": "They spent many quiet evenings together by the small fire, talking about better times.",
              "audioStart": 55.188,
              "audioEnd": 60.025
            },
            {
              "text": "Although their clothes were old and simple, they still shared a strong family bond that money could never buy.",
              "audioStart": 60.888,
              "audioEnd": 66.162
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "One day, the father heard that a ship with his goods had finally arrived at the port.",
              "audioStart": 67.025,
              "audioEnd": 71.412
            },
            {
              "text": "Before he left, he asked his children what kind of present they wanted him to bring back.",
              "audioStart": 72.275,
              "audioEnd": 76.963
            },
            {
              "text": "The older sisters requested expensive clothes and gold, but Beauty only asked for a simple red flower.",
              "audioStart": 77.825,
              "audioEnd": 83.55
            },
            {
              "text": "She did not care about gold or fine dresses because she was happy with very little.",
              "audioStart": 84.412,
              "audioEnd": 88.438
            },
            {
              "text": "The father promised that he would search everywhere for that special flower.",
              "audioStart": 89.3,
              "audioEnd": 92.875
            },
            {
              "text": "He told his daughters farewell and walked down the road toward the busy port.",
              "audioStart": 93.737,
              "audioEnd": 97.45
            },
            {
              "text": "The weather was cold, and the wind blew hard against his face as he traveled.",
              "audioStart": 98.312,
              "audioEnd": 102.287
            },
            {
              "text": "He hoped that the news about his ship was true so that he could buy new things for his family.",
              "audioStart": 103.15,
              "audioEnd": 107.388
            },
            {
              "text": "He wanted to give his children a better life and take away their daily worries.",
              "audioStart": 108.25,
              "audioEnd": 112.05
            },
            {
              "text": "The journey was long, and he felt quite tired by the time he reached the large town by the sea.",
              "audioStart": 112.912,
              "audioEnd": 117.975
            },
            {
              "text": "He walked quickly through the busy streets until he finally arrived at the harbor area.",
              "audioStart": 118.838,
              "audioEnd": 122.975
            },
            {
              "text": "Ships came and went all day, carrying goods from distant countries across the deep blue water.",
              "audioStart": 123.838,
              "audioEnd": 128.575
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "When the man reached the port, he found that his goods were gone and he had nothing.",
              "audioStart": 129.438,
              "audioEnd": 133.525
            },
            {
              "text": "During his dark and cold journey home through the forest, he lost his way in deep snow.",
              "audioStart": 134.387,
              "audioEnd": 138.762
            },
            {
              "text": "Suddenly, he saw a large castle which was bright with lights and full of food on a big table.",
              "audioStart": 139.625,
              "audioEnd": 144.7
            },
            {
              "text": "The man entered the warm building, ate a nice meal, and slept in a comfortable bed.",
              "audioStart": 145.562,
              "audioEnd": 149.95
            },
            {
              "text": "The next morning, as he walked outside, he saw a beautiful garden and picked a red flower for Beauty.",
              "audioStart": 150.812,
              "audioEnd": 156.25
            },
            {
              "text": "Immediately, a terrible creature appeared, shouting that he would kill the man for stealing his property.",
              "audioStart": 157.113,
              "audioEnd": 162.387
            },
            {
              "text": "The huge animal looked very angry, and his loud voice shook the ground beneath the man feet.",
              "audioStart": 163.25,
              "audioEnd": 168.25
            },
            {
              "text": "The frightened father explained that the flower was only a small gift for his youngest daughter.",
              "audioStart": 169.113,
              "audioEnd": 173.575
            },
            {
              "text": "The strange creature agreed to let him go if one of his daughters came to live in the castle freely.",
              "audioStart": 174.438,
              "audioEnd": 179.113
            },
            {
              "text": "The poor father felt very sad, but he knew that he had no other choice to see his family again.",
              "audioStart": 179.975,
              "audioEnd": 185.05
            },
            {
              "text": "He made the promise and quickly ran away from the dark place as fast as he could.",
              "audioStart": 185.912,
              "audioEnd": 190.025
            },
            {
              "text": "When the merchant returned home, Beauty decided to leave her life there and travel to the strange castle to save her father.",
              "audioStart": 190.887,
              "audioEnd": 196.863
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Although the creature looked frightening, he treated Beauty with great care and gave her a lovely room.",
              "audioStart": 197.725,
              "audioEnd": 202.55
            },
            {
              "text": "Every evening they talked together, and Beauty began to feel deep love for the strange animal.",
              "audioStart": 203.412,
              "audioEnd": 208.062
            },
            {
              "text": "However, after she saw in a special glass that her father was sick, she asked to visit him.",
              "audioStart": 208.925,
              "audioEnd": 214.075
            },
            {
              "text": "She told the master of the castle that she missed her family very much and needed to see her father.",
              "audioStart": 214.938,
              "audioEnd": 219.688
            },
            {
              "text": "The creature allowed her to go home for a short time, but she had to promise that she would return soon.",
              "audioStart": 220.55,
              "audioEnd": 225.725
            },
            {
              "text": "Her family was extremely happy to see her, but her stay became too long because she enjoyed being with them.",
              "audioStart": 226.588,
              "audioEnd": 232.213
            },
            {
              "text": "Suddenly, she remembered the creature, and she rushed back to the castle because she was afraid that he was dead.",
              "audioStart": 233.075,
              "audioEnd": 238.812
            },
            {
              "text": "She ran through the dark forest and entered the castle gardens as fast as possible.",
              "audioStart": 239.675,
              "audioEnd": 245.133
            },
            {
              "text": "The wind blew cold around her, and her heart beat fast with fear and worry.",
              "audioStart": 245.996,
              "audioEnd": 249.946
            },
            {
              "text": "She searched every corner of the large garden, calling out his name into the cold night air.",
              "audioStart": 250.809,
              "audioEnd": 255.184
            },
            {
              "text": "The place was completely quiet, and no one answered her calls for a long time.",
              "audioStart": 256.046,
              "audioEnd": 260.246
            },
            {
              "text": "She feared that her long delay had caused him too much pain while she was away from the castle.",
              "audioStart": 261.108,
              "audioEnd": 265.646
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "She found the poor creature down in the garden, and she cried while she held him closely.",
              "audioStart": 266.509,
              "audioEnd": 270.871
            },
            {
              "text": "Beauty told the creature that she loved him, and her love broke the dark spell.",
              "audioStart": 271.733,
              "audioEnd": 275.596
            },
            {
              "text": "The animal immediately changed into a young prince, and they lived happily together forever.",
              "audioStart": 276.459,
              "audioEnd": 281.246
            },
            {
              "text": "The prince thanked Beauty for her great love and deep care during such a difficult time.",
              "audioStart": 282.108,
              "audioEnd": 286.296
            },
            {
              "text": "He explained how a bad spell had kept him in that terrible shape until someone could love him despite his looks.",
              "audioStart": 287.159,
              "audioEnd": 292.696
            },
            {
              "text": "The old castle transformed into a bright and happy place filled with light and music.",
              "audioStart": 293.558,
              "audioEnd": 297.871
            },
            {
              "text": "Soon after that happy event, Beauty brought her father and sisters to live with them in the grand house.",
              "audioStart": 298.733,
              "audioEnd": 303.746
            },
            {
              "text": "The family never had to worry about money or food ever again.",
              "audioStart": 304.608,
              "audioEnd": 307.921
            },
            {
              "text": "The sisters learned to be kind and helpful, just like Beauty had always been.",
              "audioStart": 308.784,
              "audioEnd": 312.746
            },
            {
              "text": "They spent their days walking in the beautiful gardens and sharing wonderful meals together.",
              "audioStart": 313.608,
              "audioEnd": 317.996
            },
            {
              "text": "The prince and Beauty ruled the land with wisdom, love, and fairness for the rest of their lives.",
              "audioStart": 318.858,
              "audioEnd": 323.821
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone in the country celebrated their happy union and remembered the story for many years.",
              "audioStart": 324.683,
              "audioEnd": 329.284
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "audio": "audio/b2/st-0178.mp3",
      "wordTimings": "audio/b2/st-0178.timings.json",
